    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## OPD Saathi: morning crowd forecast\n\nEvery morning n8n asks the OPD Saathi server for today's forecast (weather, air, traffic, day of the week) and sends staff a short plan: expected patients, the busiest hour, and what to prepare.\n\n1. Open **Settings**: set the server address and the staff chat ID.\n2. Add Telegram credentials (or use Email / WhatsApp instead).\n3. Activate. To send it right away (for a demo), open the production URL of **Send it now**.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 320
      },
      "id": "2db841a9-7e94-4302-b57f-3b535452bccb",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -120
      ]
    }
